                <tr id="issuerow12753286" rel="12753286" data-issuekey="CXF-6088" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6088" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6088">CXF-6088</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                When parsing xsd:enumeration the extra &quot;underscore&quot; added by parser
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Denys Tyshetskyy
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Denys Tyshetskyy
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Nov/14 02:56 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> 25/Jul/17 13:21 </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:31 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Nov/14 18:43 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When parsing this   <br/>
<br/>
&lt;xsd:simpleType name=&quot;enum&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xsd:restriction base=&quot;xsd:string&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;xsd:enumeration value=&quot;BC9_SS&quot;/&gt;            <br/>
        &lt;/xsd:restriction&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/xsd:simpleType&gt;<br/>
<br/>
In the generated java file the element gets renamed into <br/>
<br/>
@XmlEnumValue(&quot;BC9_SS&quot;)<br/>
   BC_9_SS(&quot;BC9_SS&quot;)<br/>
<br/>
Expected behavior - <br/>
<br/>
in generated code - <br/>
<br/>
BC9_SS(&quot;BC9_SS&quot;)<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
