                <tr id="issuerow12753679" rel="12753679" data-issuekey="CXF-6092" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6092" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6092">CXF-6092</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                When there is bad connection/timeout, ClientImpl throws NullPointerException
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Nikolai Penkov
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Nikolai Penkov
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Nov/14 12:11 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Nov/14 19:59 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.11,                     2.7.12,                     2.7.13,                     3.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.3,                     2.7.14            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When the connection when executing WebService all is interrupted or timed out, there is some kind of racing issue and the result is<br/>
(the stacktrace and src code is from v. 2.7.11, but the same code is also in the other versions)<br/>
<br/>
Caused by: java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
    at org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.invoke(ClientImpl.java:396)<br/>
<br/>
I suppose the problem is that when the connection is timed out/closed, the <br/>
destroy() method is called in ClientImpl, where there is a statement that sets <br/>
responseContext = null;<br/>
<br/>
and then in the finalize block of the invoke, there is the code that produces the NPE:<br/>
<br/>
} finally {<br/>
            if (context != null) {<br/>
                Map&lt;String, Object&gt; resp = CastUtils.cast((Map&lt;?, ?&gt;)context.get(RESPONSE_CONTEXT));<br/>
                if (resp != null) {<br/>
--NPE-----&gt;                    responseContext.put(Thread.currentThread(), resp);<br/>
                }<br/>
            }<br/>
        }<br/>
<br/>
One possible solutions is to add verification also for not null value in responseContext.
  </td>
