<br/>
*Nov 03, 2014 1:11:20 PM org.apache.cxf.configuration.jsse.SSLUtils getDefaultKeyStoreManagers WARNING: Default key managers cannot be initialized: C:\Users\Administrator.keystore (The system cannot find the file specified)<br/>
