Caused by: javax.xml.bind.UnmarshalException<br/>
 - with linked exception:<br/>
[com.ctc.wstx.exc.WstxIOException: Read timed out]<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Attached Unit test  where  the issue can be reproduced easily.<br/>
<br/>
Is there any maximum size for the SOAP Messages?<br/>
<br/>
Same code was working on a previous JVM. (jdk6) <br/>
<br/>
Not sure whether is a bug or not, but it stop working with java 8.<br/>
<br/>
I would appreciate your help.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks in advance.<br/>
<br/>
