                <tr id="issuerow12756465" rel="12756465" data-issuekey="CXF-6110" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6110" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6110">CXF-6110</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                AbstractSTSClient MEX: download XML schema from Location
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Frank Cornelis
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Frank Cornelis
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Nov/14 17:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/15 16:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Nov/14 12:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.13            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.3,                     2.7.14,                     3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        STS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For MEX data like:<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
  &lt;MetadataSection<br/>
    Dialect=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema&quot;<br/>
    Identifier=&quot;http://something&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;Location&gt;https://some/location.xsd&lt;/Location&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/MetadataSection&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
the AbstractSTSClient should probably start downloading when getAny() gives NULL.<br/>
<br/>
I stumbled upon this by implementing a WS-Trust STS with a WSDL that contains schema imports instead of an embedded XML schema.<br/>
<br/>
The next patch adds this feature (quick and dirty).<br/>
{code}<br/>
