                <tr id="issuerow12757682" rel="12757682" data-issuekey="CXF-6116" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6116" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6116">CXF-6116</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                memory leak in web service client with WS Addressing feature
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Levente Kiss
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Levente Kiss
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Nov/14 12:49 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 31/Mar/17 19:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 27/Mar/17 16:51 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime,                     WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-6590                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The jax-ws web service client is causing serious memory leak if the WS-Addressing feature is enabled.<br/>
<br/>
Relevant spring context configuration:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
&lt;jaxws:client id=&quot;wsClient&quot;<br/>
		serviceClass=&quot;com.example.WebService&quot;<br/>
		address=&quot;${service.url}&quot; serviceName=&quot;s:WebService&quot;<br/>
		xmlns:s=&quot;http://ServiceContracts/2014/11/WebService&quot;<br/>
		endpointName=&quot;s:WebService&quot; bindingId=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2003/05/soap/bindings/HTTP/?mtom=true&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;jaxws:features&gt;<br/>
		&lt;wsa:addressing xmlns:wsa=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/ws/addressing&quot; /&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/jaxws:features&gt;<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:client&gt;<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
Relevant spring managed client code:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
@Autowired<br/>
private WebService webServiceClient;<br/>
<br/>
private void callClient(){<br/>
 webServiceClient.doSomething();<br/>
}<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
Memory behavior and heap dump screenshots are attached.<br/>
<br/>
In case you need the heapdump file, please let me know.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks in advance!<br/>
Levi
  </td>
