                <tr id="issuerow12758656" rel="12758656" data-issuekey="CXF-6124" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6124" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6124">CXF-6124</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Switch http transport to use HttpService for OSGi
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Dec/14 14:16 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Oct/16 18:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/Dec/14 08:17 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The current http transport relies on the Pax web whiteboard feature. <br/>
<br/>
In pax web 4 this feature also installs jsp support and a java compiler. This makes the deployment unnecesarily large. <br/>
<br/>
So I propose to switch the http transport to directly use the http service. This will allow to only depend on the much smaller http feature.
  </td>
