                                            <td class="description">      this is caused by can&#39;t find the <br/>
org.apache.karaf.http:org.apache.karaf.http.command:jar:3.0.2<br/>
and<br/>
org.apache.karaf.http:org.apache.karaf.http.core:jar:3.0.2<br/>
in both karaf kit and local maven repo<br/>
<br/>
Those two bundles is used by cxf-http feature, but it&#39;s not the default boot feature from karaf so the karaf kit won&#39;t ship those two bundles by default
