                                            <td class="description">      XSLTJaxbProvider xslt url could be configured at runtime using MessageContext:<br/>
<br/>
eg, at jax-rs method <br/>
messageContext.put(&quot;xslt.template&quot;,&quot;stylesheets/path/to/xsl&quot;);<br/>
<br/>
and in XSLTJaxbProvider::getOutTemplates <br/>
{code:title=XSLTJaxbProvider.java|borderStyle=solid}<br/>
        MessageContext mc = getContext();<br/>
        if (mc != null) {<br/>
            String template=(String)mc.getContextualProperty(&quot;xslt.template&quot;);<br/>
            if(template!=null){<br/>
                t=createTemplates(template);<br/>
            }<br/>
        }<br/>
{code}<br/>
