                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
I am using apache cxf 2.6.11 with org.apache.cxf.transport.jms.JMSConfiguration.<br/>
which internally creates SingleConnectionFactory.initconnection eveytime a request is made.<br/>
<br/>
However the connections are only closed after the Conduit.finalize is called.<br/>
<br/>
I am not sure whats incorrect in my configuration. have tried researching for quite some time now.<br/>
<br/>
Any help is appreciated<br/>
<br/>
Thanks<br/>
Tia<br/>

  </td>
