                <tr id="issuerow12762253" rel="12762253" data-issuekey="CXF-6161" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6161" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6161">CXF-6161</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                wsdl2java can use invalid local filename when working with wsdl imports
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Martijn Aben
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Martijn Aben
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Dec/14 10:45 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Apr/17 19:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Mar/17 17:45 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.14            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.13,                     3.1.11            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows platform
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using wsdl2java on an WSDL which has an wsdl import like:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;wsdl:import namespace=&quot;http://tempuri.org/MyService/ExternalWSDL&quot; location=&quot;http://localhost/WebApplication1/WebService1.asmx?wsdl=wsdl1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
WSDLToJavaContainer.generateLocalWSDL tries to create a temporary file on disk named &quot;WebService1.asmx?wsdl=wsdl1&quot; on Windows this is an invalid filename due to the question mark (?).<br/>
<br/>
I have a proposed solution for this: just like with schema imports simply use a numbered file on disk importNN.wsdl. I will be submitting a pull request for this soon.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
