                                            <td class="description">      Currently, if user forget to configure services in provider, the STS returns generic SOAP fault and writes warning message into the log file (&quot;The Service cannot match the received AppliesTo address&quot;). Unfortunately it is quite difficult to analyze this problem.<br/>
