</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
There is a bug in the WS-SecurityPolicy layer in CXF when matching a request message against a Signed/Encrypted Elements security policy with multiple XPath expressions. The namespace/prefixes are only read from the first XPath policy, meaning that if the second or subsequent policy uses a different prefix that isn&#39;t in scope, the policy validation will fail.
