                <tr id="issuerow12769300" rel="12769300" data-issuekey="CXF-6216" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6216" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6216">CXF-6216</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                No output sanitizing in FormattedServiceListWriter 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Donald Kwakkel
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Donald Kwakkel
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Jan/15 13:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Mar/17 17:24 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Nov/16 16:13 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.9,                     3.0.12,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-7128                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      No output sanitizing is done, which makes the code vulnerable for injection. I do not have a specific use case, but it is good habit to do. Maybe you can use the OWASP Sanitizer: https://www.owasp.org/index.php/OWASP_Java_HTML_Sanitizer_Project<br/>
<br/>
One example from the file: <br/>
        writer.write(&quot;&lt;span class=\&quot;field\&quot;&gt;Endpoint address:&lt;/span&gt; &quot; + &quot;&lt;span class=\&quot;value\&quot;&gt;&quot;<br/>
                     + absoluteURL + &quot;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;);<br/>

  </td>
