</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am trying to use portable extension to get working CDI 1.2 and CXF 3.0.2 on Apache Karaf. I wrapped it into OSGi bundle. I installed to my container also:<br/>
<br/>
* weld 2.1.1<br/>
* pax-cdi-1.2<br/>
* pax-cdi-1.2-web<br/>
* pax-cdi-web-weld<br/>
<br/>
My JAXRS resources are not found by extension because some line from class **JAXRSCdiResourceExtension** returns false even annotated element contains proper annotation but as a proxy (see attachment image / screenshot from debugger).<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
        if (event.getAnnotated().isAnnotationPresent(ApplicationPath.class)) {<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
It would be nice,  to tell me how to get it working. I also tested CDI-1.1. Same situation.
  </td>
