java.lang.NullPointerException: null<br/>
   at org.apache.cxf.rs.security.oauth2.utils.AuthorizationUtils.getAuthorizationParts(AuthorizationUtils.java:76) ~[cxf-rt-rs-security-oauth2-3.0.3.jar:3.0.3]<br/>
