                <tr id="issuerow12774694" rel="12774694" data-issuekey="CXF-6255" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6255" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6255">CXF-6255</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WSS4JInInterceptor: &quot;Security header, but it&#39;s a fault&quot;
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Richard O&#39;Sullivan
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Richard O&#39;Sullivan
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 12/Feb/15 20:56 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:23 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Feb/15 11:54 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1,                     3.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When CXF processes a SoapFault it logs this WARNing: &quot;Request does not contain Security header, but it&#39;s a fault.&quot;. The message is logged from the handleMessage at WSS4JInInterceptor in the package org.apache.cxf.ws.security.wss4j.<br/>
<br/>
The message is cryptic but I think it is intended to be an INFO or DEBUG instead of a WARN.<br/>
<br/>
If I&#39;m correct please make this an INFO or a DEBUG; otherwise, rewrite the message to indicate a course of action to eliminate the warning.
