                                            <td class="description">      I am working on upgrading CXF framework on a Maven Webservice. It worked successfully on CXF version 2.2.6; but I am getting following error when I am trying to upgrade CXF version to 3.0.2;<br/>
<br/>
JDK 1.7;<br/>
Apache Tomcat - 7.0.39;<br/>
NetBeans IDE 7.3;<br/>
<br/>
I went through almost all topics related to this in web, but could not find a way out.<br/>
<br/>
My implementation is:<br/>
<br/>
