</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6268" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6268">CXF-6268</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Make cxf-codegen-plugin toolchains aware during maven build
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jeremie H
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jeremie H
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Feb/15 23:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:23 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 31/Mar/15 18:37 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.6.16,                     3.0.4,                     2.7.15            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1,                     3.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m working on a project built with Java 1.6. I though it could be a good idea to set up the {{maven-toolchains-plugin}}. <br/>
<br/>
Unfortunately the {{cxf-codegen-plugin}} uses the java available in the {{java.home}} system property. Although this can be configured with the {{javaExecutable}} property of the mojo, it generates configuration duplication.<br/>
<br/>
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/MAVENOLD/Toolchains seems to show an easy way to do that.
  </td>
