                <tr id="issuerow12777882" rel="12777882" data-issuekey="CXF-6270" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6270" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6270">CXF-6270</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                jaxrs:client does not work in blueprint
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Feb/15 13:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/Apr/15 16:37 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When I use the blueprint below then &lt;jaxrs-client:client..&gt; works but &lt;jaxrs:client ...&gt;  does not work.<br/>
<br/>
Accoding to Sergey both variants should work and in spring both actually work.<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;blueprint xmlns=&quot;http://www.osgi.org/xmlns/blueprint/v1.0.0&quot;<br/>
xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;<br/>
xmlns:cm=&quot;http://aries.apache.org/blueprint/xmlns/blueprint-cm/v1.1.0&quot; <br/>
xmlns:jaxrs=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/blueprint/jaxrs&quot;<br/>
xmlns:jaxrs-client=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/blueprint/jaxrs-client&quot;<br/>
    xsi:schemaLocation=&quot;<br/>
  http://www.osgi.org/xmlns/blueprint/v1.0.0 http://www.osgi.org/xmlns/blueprint/v1.0.0/blueprint.xsd<br/>
  http://cxf.apache.org/blueprint/jaxrs http://cxf.apache.org/schemas/blueprint/jaxrs.xsd<br/>
