                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Blueprint NamespaceHandlerRegisterer reports not working with Aries using log level WARN. <br/>
<br/>
In most cases there should not be a real problem that is worth reporting on a problematic log level. So an INFO should be sufficient.<br/>
<br/>
Some of your customers are paying very much attention to their production log files. All WARN and ERROR entries tend to cause some amount of discussion.
  </td>
