                <tr id="issuerow12779783" rel="12779783" data-issuekey="CXF-6276" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6276" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6276">CXF-6276</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Some non-primitive properties lost during generating WADL
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Pengling Qian
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Pengling Qian
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Mar/15 13:16 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:23 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/Mar/15 16:28 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.4,                     2.7.15            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1,                     2.7.16,                     3.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      There are 2 classes:<br/>
Team {<br/>
  String teamName;<br/>
  Person manager;<br/>
  Person member;<br/>
}<br/>
Person {<br/>
  String firstName;<br/>
  String lastName;<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
if Team is an object annotated with @FormParam(&quot;&quot;) in a POST service method, then the generated WADL seems like the following:<br/>
&lt;representation mediaType=&quot;application/x-www-form-urlencoded&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;param name=&quot;teamName&quot; style=&quot;query&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
  &lt;param name=&quot;manager.firstName&quot; style=&quot;query&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
  &lt;param name=&quot;manager.lastName&quot; style=&quot;query&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/representation&gt;<br/>
as you saw, &quot;member&quot; get lose. Sometimes the lost is &quot;manager&quot;.<br/>

  </td>
