                <tr id="issuerow12780743" rel="12780743" data-issuekey="CXF-6285" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6285" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6285">CXF-6285</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                NPE in SwaggerFeature.calculateDefaultResourcePackage
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            David J. M. Karlsen
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            David J. M. Karlsen
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Mar/15 07:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:24 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Mar/15 14:47 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1,                     3.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If I &quot;instrument&quot; my resources with some AOP (using JDK proxies), I cannot boot CXF when using the SwaggerFeature.<br/>
<br/>
Caused by: java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.swagger.SwaggerFeature.calculateDefaultResourcePackage(SwaggerFeature.java:99)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.swagger.SwaggerFeature.initialize(SwaggerFeature.java:62)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.JAXRSServerFactoryBean.applyFeatures(JAXRSServerFactoryBean.java:252)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.JAXRSServerFactoryBean.create(JAXRSServerFactoryBean.java:196)<br/>
	... 46 more<br/>

