                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When setting property &quot;ws-security.ut.validator&quot; on an endpoint, I get the following exception:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
16:38:02,007 WARNING [org.apache.cxf.phase.PhaseInterceptorChain] (http-/127.0.0.1:8080-2) Interceptor for {http://test}SimpleWSS4JImpl has thrown exception, unwinding now: java.lang.ClassCastException: java.lang.String cannot be cast to org.apache.ws.security.validate.Validator<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.ws.security.wss4j.UsernameTokenInterceptor$1.getValidator(UsernameTokenInterceptor.java:165)<br/>
	at org.apache.ws.security.processor.UsernameTokenProcessor.handleToken(UsernameTokenProcessor.java:66) [wss4j-1.6.15.redhat-1.jar:1.6.15.redhat-1]<br/>
