                <tr id="issuerow12783581" rel="12783581" data-issuekey="CXF-6308" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6308" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6308">CXF-6308</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Make WebSocket transport&#39;s embedded jetty mode to use atmosphere if available
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Mar/15 12:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:23 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Apr/15 11:39 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1,                     3.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The original implementation of the embedded mode in the WebSocket transport component directly used jetty and all the relevant protocol processing is done specifically for jetty. <br/>
<br/>
This patch makes this embedded mode to use atmosphere if it is available so that all the custom extensions that are used by the servlet mode can also be used for the embedded mode. <br/>

  </td>
