                <tr id="issuerow12783639" rel="12783639" data-issuekey="CXF-6310" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6310" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6310">CXF-6310</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Signature validation of body request fails but it works fine for other request elements
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Cannot Reproduce
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            AKROUR
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            AKROUR
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Mar/15 15:09 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Mar/17 07:13 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Mar/17 07:13 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.14            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      WS server running on Windows x64<br/>
WS client on SAP NetWeaver
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When I connect my client (SAP NW) to WS service (CXF 2.7.14) I get the following fault:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
&lt;faultcode xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-wssecurity-secext-1.0.xsd&quot;&gt;ns1:FailedCheck&lt;/faultcode&gt;<br/>
&lt;faultstring&gt;The signature or decryption was invalid&lt;/faultstring&gt;<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
The WS service authenticate the user via an SAML Token that must have at least a Signed Timestamp and a Signed Body request.<br/>
When I enable the debug logs, we can see that the signature of the Timestamp element is successfully validated by CXF 2.7.14 but the signature of the Body request fails (see following logs):<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
 ....<br/>
