                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF&#39;s WebSocket transport using atmosphere can use other web container. However, its transport factory has some jetty references and as a result, it is requiring jetty classes even when using other container such as tomcat.<br/>
<br/>
Those references should be removed so that those jetty classes are not required when jetty is not used.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

