                                            <td class="description">      Currently, the WebSocket based tests in systests/jaxrs are executed either with or without atmosphere depending on the availability of atmosphere during the runtime, which is controled by the build profile. By default, this profile is not active.<br/>
<br/>
To be able to test both cases during a normal test run, we are adding adding atmosphere dependency and adding a system property to disable atmosphere. <br/>
<br/>

