                <tr id="issuerow12786711" rel="12786711" data-issuekey="CXF-6322" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6322" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6322">CXF-6322</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                AbstractSearchConditionParser not working with UUID fields
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Vjacheslav Borisov
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Vjacheslav Borisov
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Mar/15 12:50 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:24 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Apr/15 15:43 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1,                     3.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Using of FIQL expression like bean.uuid=91d6350e-4bf5-42e8-9828-33767c6cb384<br/>
Where uuid is of type java.util.UUID<br/>
<br/>
leads to  java.lang.InstantiationException: java.util.UUID<br/>
at line 194: nextObject = returnType.newInstance();<br/>
<br/>
Becouse  java.util.UUID does not have no-arg constructor.<br/>
Istead of this InjectionUtils.isPrimitive should return true for java.util.UUID, then execution path should go to if (lastTry) { branch<br/>
and convertStringToPrimitive is working correctly with java.util.UUID<br/>
<br/>
Quick fix is to change  line 168  - add  &quot; ||returnType.equals(java.util.UUID.class): &quot;<br/>
                boolean isPrimitive = !returnCollection<br/>
                    &amp;&amp; InjectionUtils.isPrimitive(returnType) || returnType.isEnum() ||returnType.equals(java.util.UUID.class);<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
