                <tr id="issuerow12786994" rel="12786994" data-issuekey="CXF-6324" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6324" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6324">CXF-6324</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                cxf-codegen-plugin: classifier ignored when there are more then one client project with the same parent
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Fabrizio Giovannetti
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Fabrizio Giovannetti
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Mar/15 11:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/Mar/17 19:00 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.4,                     2.7.15            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Given this project structure:<br/>
<br/>
parent<br/>
- client1<br/>
- client2<br/>
<br/>
and<br/>
<br/>
client1 with this configuration<br/>
  &lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
        &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
        &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-codegen-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
        &lt;version&gt;3.0.4&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
        &lt;executions&gt;<br/>
          &lt;execution&gt;<br/>
            &lt;id&gt;generate-sources&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
            &lt;phase&gt;generate-sources&lt;/phase&gt;<br/>
            &lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
              &lt;sourceRoot&gt;${project.build.directory}/generated-sources/cxf&lt;/sourceRoot&gt;<br/>
              &lt;wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
                &lt;wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
                   &lt;wsdlArtifact&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;groupId&gt;com.company&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;artifactId&gt;company-services&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;version&gt;1.0&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;classifier&gt;catService&lt;/classifier&gt;<br/>
                   &lt;/wsdlArtifact&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
              &lt;defaultOptions&gt;<br/>
                &lt;faultSerialVersionUID&gt;FQCN&lt;/faultSerialVersionUID&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/defaultOptions&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
            &lt;goals&gt;<br/>
              &lt;goal&gt;wsdl2java&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
          &lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/executions&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
<br/>
and client 2 with this configuration<br/>
&lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
        &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
        &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-codegen-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
        &lt;version&gt;3.0.4&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
        &lt;executions&gt;<br/>
          &lt;execution&gt;<br/>
            &lt;id&gt;generate-sources&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
            &lt;phase&gt;generate-sources&lt;/phase&gt;<br/>
            &lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
              &lt;sourceRoot&gt;${project.build.directory}/generated-sources/cxf&lt;/sourceRoot&gt;<br/>
              &lt;wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
                &lt;wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
                   &lt;wsdlArtifact&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;groupId&gt;com.company&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;artifactId&gt;company-services&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;version&gt;1.0&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;classifier&gt;dogService&lt;/classifier&gt;<br/>
                   &lt;/wsdlArtifact&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
              &lt;defaultOptions&gt;<br/>
                &lt;faultSerialVersionUID&gt;FQCN&lt;/faultSerialVersionUID&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/defaultOptions&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
            &lt;goals&gt;<br/>
              &lt;goal&gt;wsdl2java&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
          &lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/executions&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
When the the build is executed of the parent project<br/>
 <br/>
<br/>
then:<br/>
cxf-codegen-plugin in client1 fetch correctly the <br/>
<br/>
com.company:company-services:1.0:catService from the repository to generate the artifacts<br/>
<br/>
BUT<br/>
<br/>
cxf-codegen-plugin in client2 fetch <br/>
<br/>
com.company:company-services:1.0:catService<br/>
<br/>
instead of<br/>
<br/>
com.company:company-services:1.0:dogService<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
In other words, the classifier of the second client project is ignored and the plugin uses for that the classifier present in the configuration of the first client.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
