                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      WadlGenerator seems to handle correctly @Description annotation on class level, and so on class fields.<br/>
However the @Description cannot be assigned to Field:<br/>
@Target({java.lang.annotation.ElementType.TYPE, java.lang.annotation.ElementType.METHOD, java.lang.annotation.ElementType.PARAMETER})<br/>
<br/>
Can you change this to:<br/>
@Target({java.lang.annotation.ElementType.TYPE, java.lang.annotation.ElementType.METHOD, java.lang.annotation.ElementType.PARAMETER,<br/>
java.lang.annotation.ElementType.FIELD})
  </td>
