                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      when using jaxrs 2 client api it is quite common to desire to configure timeouts (receive, connect). To do it today you need to unwrap the Client to get its config then the http conduit. Would be great to be able to do it - or have a client specific config - through properties of the client/client builder to try to not force user of the standard API to import CXF.
  </td>
