                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi, I have a resource method as below:  <br/>
 @GET<br/>
        @Path(&quot;setmethod&quot;)<br/>
        public String setMethod1() {<br/>
        	 ServiceUnavailableException e = new ServiceUnavailableException(new Date());<br/>
        	 e.getRetryTime(new Date());<br/>
            ....}<br/>
In this method, I simply construct a ServiceUnavailableException with Date parameter. Then when it runs into  e.getRetryTime(new Date()) it give below error:<br/>
java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
at javax.ws.rs.ServiceUnavailableException.getRetryTime(ServiceUnavailableException.java:262)
  </td>
