                                            <td class="description">      CXF is used in many distributed systems and microservice architectures. In such deployments distributed tracing becomes really crucial in order to capture each subsystem / service health and react on any issues fast enough. Apache HTrace is one of the emerging projects in the distributed systems tracing space.<br/>
<br/>
Documentation:<br/>
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/CXF20DOC/Distributed+Tracing<br/>
