  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Resource class<br/>
public Response getMediaType() {<br/>
		MediaType media = MediaType.APPLICATION_ATOM_XML_TYPE;<br/>
		Response response = Response.ok().type(media).build();<br/>
		return response;<br/>
	}<br/>
<br/>
get media type from response on client side is  null.<br/>
Spec 3.8 Determining the MediaType of Responses<br/>
1. If the method returns an instance of Response whose metadata includes the response media type<br/>
(Mspecified) then set Mselected = Mspecified, finish.
