</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JavaScript client generation does not include imported/included XSDs related objects in generated Javascript file
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
