                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6394" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6394">CXF-6394</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add an option to add the namespace map of the container element in the message
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/May/15 17:50 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:25 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/May/15 08:49 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.1,                     3.0.6,                     2.7.17            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Soap Binding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CAMEL-8663                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When there is no DOM node is created during the inbound SOAP message processing, the body child is represented by the Source object. <br/>
<br/>
It seems reasonable to add an option to create a map containing the namespace declarations during the SOAP envelope parsing and put it in the message so that one can directly access this map later in their application (e.g. in camel-cxf).<br/>
<br/>
This behavior is related to the recent versions of CXF which no longer create a DOM node by default.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
