                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The transport can be optimized to further avoid costly String&lt;-&gt;URI&lt;-&gt;URL conversions, improving the changes committed at https://github.com/apache/cxf/commit/5a9a2a09887c69cdfeff5eac22996ab35fbfc0cf . Moreover, the actual http connection opening can be speed up by always providing a http proxy instance (that is providing Proxy.NO_PROXY when we already know no proxy will eventually be resolved).
