                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
Currently, we can only select one protocol to use for the Jetty TLS Server. This is inconvenient if you wish to support others, e.g. SSLv2Hello support for older clients, etc. A new &quot;IncludeProtocols&quot; section will be available in the configuration, mirroring the existing &quot;ExcludeProtocols&quot;.
