                <tr id="issuerow12831051" rel="12831051" data-issuekey="CXF-6415" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6415" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6415">CXF-6415</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WS-RM client persistent tests are failing
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/May/15 15:42 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:25 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/May/15 09:39 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.1,                     3.0.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-6655,                                                CXF-6404                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      All WS-RM client persistence/restart tests in systests/ws-rm seem to be almost permanently failing in master and 3.0.x at the moment. The reason seems to be the restarting of the retransmission occurs before the test client can overwrite the target address (using the dynamic port number) which replaces the default target address specified in the WSDL.<br/>
<br/>
I am not really sure which change has caused this and I am looking into it.<br/>
<br/>
This problem was not observed in 3.0.5/3.1.0.
  </td>
