                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is similar to CXF-5778, but here it is pubSubNoLocal that is not propagated.<br/>
As a result, session.createDurableSubscriber is called with possibly the wrong value of this setting.<br/>
<br/>
I tested it in 3.0.5. <br/>
In 3.1.0 I can see in the code that this property is also not set in the JMSDestination class, so I guess it&#39;s not fixed there either.
  </td>
