                <tr id="issuerow12836156" rel="12836156" data-issuekey="CXF-6444" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6444" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6444">CXF-6444</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CrossOriginResourceSharingFilter.java should not set Origin=* when Credentials=true
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Justin SB
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Justin SB
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Jun/15 14:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Jun/15 11:13 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.6,                     2.7.17,                     3.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS Security            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      According to this: http://www.w3.org/TR/cors/#resource-preflight-requests<br/>
<br/>
...when Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true is set, the response Origin: must be the same as the request Origin (see bullet #7).<br/>
<br/>
It doesn&#39;t say why in the RFC (that I could see), but I presume there are security implications.
  </td>
