</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-6449                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Feature cxf-transports-websocket-server of CXF 3.1.1 uses atmosphere-runtime 2.3.0 which does not mark its CDI dependency as optional.  Therefore, you cannot install this feature if you do not have a CDI bundle.<br/>
<br/>
Either you will have to install one of the CDI feature pax-cdi-* or install the newer atmosphere 2.3.2 or older ones 2.2.x.<br/>

