                                            <td class="environment">      Windows, Java HotSpot(TM) 64-Bit Server VM (build 24.60-b09, mixed mode)
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Autowired HttpServletRequest updated to wrapped version in FrameworkServlet.processRequest() via RequestContextHolder.setRequestAttributes(), so that further processes which rely on Autowired HttpServletRequest can get wrapped version not original version. <br/>
While CXF spring integration don&#39;t update it, and it will get original request not wrapped version.
