</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am using CXF client in Play Framework. Recenty I have moved to latest version of Play Framework, but after that I am receiving this error:<br/>
[RuntimeException: org.springframework.beans.factory.xml.XmlBeanDefinitionStoreException: Line 55 in XML document from class path resource [spring-config-jaxrs-client.xml] is invalid; nested exception is org.xml.sax.SAXParseException; systemId: jar:file:/C:/Users/Łukasz/.ivy2/cache/org.apache.cxf/cxf-rt-transports-http/jars/cxf-rt-transports-http-2.7.12.jar!/schemas/configuration/http-conf.xsd; lineNumber: 55; columnNumber: 66; src-resolve: Cannot resolve the name &#39;http-conf:client&#39; to a(n) &#39;element declaration&#39; component.]<br/>
<br/>
I have also tried latest CXF version 3.1.1, but still the same error.
