                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have rest services with generate the service list /service, when I click on url ?_wadl I receive a error (Not Found - 404) on logger.<br/>
<br/>
I debug the code and saw that on class ServerProviderFactory initialize a wadlGenerator using provider &quot;org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.model.wadl.WadlGenerator&quot;, but this class not exists on my maven dependecy.<br/>
<br/>
I download the binary on cxf.apache.org and I saw that jar &quot;cxf-rt-frontend-jaxrs-3.1.0.jar&quot; doesn&#39;t have the class, but in the javadoc has &quot;https://cxf.apache.org/javadoc/latest/org/apache/cxf/jaxrs/model/wadl/WadlGenerator.html&quot;
  </td>
