{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
If I subclass MockHttpServletRequest and have it return an empty ServletInputStream instead of null, then CXF works without throwing the NPE.<br/>
<br/>
Just to be defensive, you might want to check for null return values from HttpServletRequest.getInputStream(). It seems like several people have run into issues with this, like this mailing list post:<br/>
<br/>
http://mail-archives.apache.org/mod_mbox/cxf-users/201104.mbox/%3C1303876123106-4342671.post@n5.nabble.com%3E
