                <tr id="issuerow12839350" rel="12839350" data-issuekey="CXF-6469" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6469" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6469">CXF-6469</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                schemaLocation in xsd import is not rewritten correctly in Java 8
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Rebecca Searls
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Rebecca Searls
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Jun/15 15:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Jun/15 16:10 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.6,                     2.7.17,                     3.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This issue exists for the current and all previous cxf versions that will be run with Java 8.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Java 7 and Java 8 yield different rewritten schemaLocations for an app that processes multiple<br/>
wsdls.<br/>
<br/>
Using Java 7, their XSD schemaLocations are correctly expanded like this:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;http://localhost:8080/SmpOrderMgrWebServices/JVTOrderManagementSessionSOAP12?xsd=OSSJ-Common-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEBi/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;http://localhost:8080/SmpOrderMgrWebServices/JVTOrderManagementSessionSOAP12?xsd=OSSJ-Common-CBEBi-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBECore/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;http://localhost:8080/SmpOrderMgrWebServices/JVTOrderManagementSessionSOAP12?xsd=OSSJ-Common-CBECore-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEResource/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;http://localhost:8080/SmpOrderMgrWebServices/JVTOrderManagementSessionSOAP12?xsd=OSSJ-Common-CBEResource-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEDatatypes/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;http://localhost:8080/SmpOrderMgrWebServices/JVTOrderManagementSessionSOAP12?xsd=OSSJ-Common-CBEDatatypes-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEProduct/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;http://localhost:8080/SmpOrderMgrWebServices/JVTOrderManagementSessionSOAP12?xsd=OSSJ-Common-CBEProduct-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEProductOffering/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;http://localhost:8080/SmpOrderMgrWebServices/JVTOrderManagementSessionSOAP12?xsd=OSSJ-Common-CBEProductOffering-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEService/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;http://localhost:8080/SmpOrderMgrWebServices/JVTOrderManagementSessionSOAP12?xsd=OSSJ-Common-CBEService-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEParty/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;http://localhost:8080/SmpOrderMgrWebServices/JVTOrderManagementSessionSOAP12?xsd=OSSJ-Common-CBEParty-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
But on Java 8, only the first schemaLocation is expanded, the others are not:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;http://localhost:8080/SmpOrderMgrWebServices/JVTOrderManagementSessionSOAP12?xsd=OSSJ-Common-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEBi/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;./OSSJ-Common-CBEBi-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBECore/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;./OSSJ-Common-CBECore-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEResource/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;./OSSJ-Common-CBEResource-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEDatatypes/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;./OSSJ-Common-CBEDatatypes-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEProduct/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;./OSSJ-Common-CBEProduct-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEProductOffering/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;./OSSJ-Common-CBEProductOffering-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEService/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;./OSSJ-Common-CBEService-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;import namespace=&quot;http://ossj.org/xml/Common-CBEParty/v1-5&quot; schemaLocation=&quot;./OSSJ-Common-CBEParty-v1-5.xsd&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
To reproduce the issue, all you need to do is deploy the attached war file (SmpOrderMgrWebServices.war) and point your browser to:<br/>
http://localhost:8080/SmpOrderMgrWebServices/JVTOrderManagementSessionSOAP12?xsd=OSSJ-OrderManagement-v1-0.xsd<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
