                <tr id="issuerow12839509" rel="12839509" data-issuekey="CXF-6471" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6471" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6471">CXF-6471</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Corrupted Soap:envelope in client call
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sergey Peryshkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sergey Peryshkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Jun/15 10:42 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Jun/15 10:44 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.8,                     2.7.15            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Soap Binding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Talend ESB 5.5.2; Talend ESB 5.6.2.
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m using a generated by CXF&#39;s wsdl2java maven plugin Remedy AR web service client.<br/>
After updating ESB from 5.1.1 to 5.5.2 and then to 5.6.2 Soap call from Talend ESB became corrupted.<br/>
<br/>
This is the call from 5.1.x (w. CXF 2.6.15 - 2.7.7):<br/>
Encoding: UTF-8<br/>
Content-Type: text/xml<br/>
Headers:{Accept=[*/*], SOAPAction=[&quot;urn:IT_Helpdesk/Create&quot;]}<br/>
Payload:<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;soap:Header&gt;&lt;AuthenticationInfo xmlns=&quot;urn:IT_Helpdesk&quot;&gt;&lt;userName&gt;user&lt;/userName&gt;&lt;password&gt;xxxx&lt;/password&gt;&lt;/AuthenticationInfo&gt;&lt;/soap:Header&gt;&lt;soap:Body&gt;&lt;Create xmlns=&quot;urn:IT_Helpdesk&quot;&gt;&lt;Technical_Group_ID&gt;000000000000078&lt;/Technical_Group_ID&gt;&lt;Technical_Specialist_ID&gt;000000000002162&lt;/Technical_Specialist_ID&gt;&lt;Curator_ID&gt;000000000002162&lt;/Curator_ID&gt;&lt;Request_Kind&gt;Инцидент&lt;/Request_Kind&gt;&lt;Short_Description&gt;test&lt;/Short_Description&gt;&lt;MatrixSelect&gt;000000000000512&lt;/MatrixSelect&gt;&lt;Priority&gt;04&lt;/Priority&gt;&lt;TT_Status&gt;New&lt;/TT_Status&gt;&lt;Request_Type&gt;WEB&lt;/Request_Type&gt;&lt;Requestor&gt;Peryshkin Sergey&lt;/Requestor&gt;&lt;Contact_Phone&gt;4432&lt;/Contact_Phone&gt;&lt;Technical_Group&gt;IT Helpdesk&lt;/Technical_Group&gt;&lt;Technical_Specoalist&gt;support&lt;/Technical_Specoalist&gt;&lt;Curator&gt;support&lt;/Curator&gt;&lt;Short_Note&gt;test&lt;/Short_Note&gt;&lt;Note_Preview&gt;test&lt;/Note_Preview&gt;&lt;Email_Autor_value&gt;sergey.peryshkin@orange.com&lt;/Email_Autor_value&gt;&lt;Email_Autor&gt;0&lt;/Email_Autor&gt;&lt;Email_Curator_value&gt;rus.support@orange.com&lt;/Email_Curator_value&gt;&lt;Email_Curator&gt;0&lt;/Email_Curator&gt;&lt;Email_Tech_value&gt;rus.support@orange.com&lt;/Email_Tech_value&gt;&lt;Email_Tech&gt;0&lt;/Email_Tech&gt;&lt;Email_Auto_ON&gt;0&lt;/Email_Auto_ON&gt;&lt;vip&gt;&lt;/vip&gt;&lt;/Create&gt;&lt;/soap:Body&gt;&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Here is what I get under 5.5.2/5.6.2 (CXF 2.7.11, 2.7.15, ...):<br/>
Encoding: UTF-8<br/>
Http-Method: POST<br/>
Content-Type: text/xml<br/>
Headers: {Accept=[*/*], SOAPAction=[&quot;urn:IT_Helpdesk/Create&quot;]}<br/>
Payload:<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;soap:Body&gt;&lt;Create xmlns=&quot;urn:IT_Helpdesk&quot; xmlns:xsi=&quot;&quot; xsi:type=&quot;AuthenticationInfo&quot;&gt;&lt;userName&gt;user&lt;/userName&gt;&lt;password&gt;xxxx&lt;/password&gt;&lt;/Create&gt;&lt;/soap:Body&gt;&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Soap:header becomes mixed with Soap:body somehow, with &quot;AuthenticationInfo&quot; header being pasted into operation part...<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m tested in in a clean command line call, without any dependencies except CXF, and discovered that anything&#39;s fine with 2.6.0 - 2.7.7.<br/>
And payload is corrupted with 2.7.8 - 2.7.16.
  </td>
