                <tr id="issuerow12843526" rel="12843526" data-issuekey="CXF-6489" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6489" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6489">CXF-6489</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Cannot set ClientSecretVerifier in AbstractTokenService
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Berto Murillo
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Berto Murillo
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Jul/15 14:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/Jul/15 14:41 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.6,                     3.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS Security            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A field was added to org.apache.cxf.rs.security.oauth2.services.AbstractTokenService:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
private ClientSecretVerifier clientSecretVerifier;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
But no setter was added with it.  When I tried to set it via the context XML like such:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
    &lt;bean id=&quot;hashedSecretVerifier&quot; class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.rs.security.oauth2.provider.ClientSecretHashVerifier&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;bean id=&quot;accessTokenService&quot; class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.rs.security.oauth2.services.AccessTokenService&quot;&gt;<br/>
        ...<br/>
        &lt;property name=&quot;clientSecretVerifier&quot; ref=&quot;hashedSecretVerifier&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        ...<br/>
    &lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
I get a failure when the application attempts to start.  Removing it resolves the issue.
  </td>
