    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6496" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6496">CXF-6496</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                NPE in SamlAssertionWrapper.assertionToString()
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Matthias Müller
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Matthias Müller
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Jul/15 07:53 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 14/Jul/15 13:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1,                     3.1.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.6,                     3.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The assertionToString()-Method leads to a NullPointerException in org.opensaml.core.xml.io.AbstractXMLObjectMarshaller:<br/>
{code}<br/>
java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
	at org.opensaml.core.xml.io.AbstractXMLObjectMarshaller.marshall(AbstractXMLObjectMarshaller.java:74)<br/>
	at org.apache.wss4j.common.saml.OpenSAMLUtil.toDom(OpenSAMLUtil.java:170)<br/>
	at org.apache.wss4j.common.saml.OpenSAMLUtil.toDom(OpenSAMLUtil.java:142)<br/>
	at org.apache.wss4j.common.saml.SamlAssertionWrapper.toDOM(SamlAssertionWrapper.java:271)<br/>
	at org.apache.wss4j.common.saml.SamlAssertionWrapper.assertionToString(SamlAssertionWrapper.java:282)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.SamlAssertionToStringTest.generateSamlV20TokenString(SamlAssertionToStringTest.java:24)<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
This function is working with CXF Version 3.0.5 (where opensaml 2.6 is used). From Version 3.1.0 (opensaml 3.0) on it&#39;s not working. Maybe it&#39;s a problem in opensaml 3.0, maybe CXF is not initializing opensaml 3.0 correct.
  </td>
