                                            <td class="environment">      Apache CXF 3.0.5
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi There <br/>
<br/>
I am using JaxwsDynamicClient and I am trying to generate classes for a wsdl for which i am gettting &quot; A class/interface with the same name &quot;XXXXXX&quot; is already in use. Use a class customization to resolve this conflict.&quot; There is a way using Apache CXF i.e autoNameResolution but is there a way to achieve using dynamic client.<br/>
<br/>
I tried using <br/>
{code}<br/>
JaxWsDynamicClientFactory factory = JaxWsDynamicClientFactory.newInstance();<br/>
<br/>
String options [] = {&quot;XautoNameResolution&quot;};<br/>
<br/>
factory.setSchemaCompilerOptions(options);<br/>
{code}<br/>
but no luck. Please help me in this regard.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks in Advance
  </td>
