                <tr id="issuerow12848500" rel="12848500" data-issuekey="CXF-6507" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6507" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6507">CXF-6507</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WSRM 3.0 may store corrupted message
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Akitoshi Yoshida
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Kai Rommel
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Kai Rommel
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Jul/15 10:14 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Jul/15 13:32 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.6,                     3.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-4866                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      With CXF-4866 the &#39;CaptureEnd&#39; interceptor was introduced.<br/>
This interceptor is placed in the phase post-protocol.<br/>
In my case the message was stored without the ending tags &lt;/soap:Body&gt;&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
These tags are written in the phase &#39;write-ending&#39; by the interceptor &#39;SoapOutEndingInterceptor&#39;.<br/>
So placing the &#39;CaptureEnd&#39; interceptor in the phase &#39;pre-stream-ending&#39; solved the issue.<br/>
<br/>
Remark: This error occurred, because I used another parser than the woodstox parser. The woodstox parser has the property &#39;com.ctc.wstx.automaticEndElements&#39;. When this parameter is set to true, message is stored with end tags.
  </td>
