</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-4392 issue has introduced special method for logged message format.<br/>
<br/>
All *log(logger, buffer.toString());* strings have been replaced by *log(logger, formatLoggingMessage(buffer));*<br/>
<br/>
But current version of *LoggingOutInterceptor.LogWriter.close()* contains log(..) method call without format:<br/>
https://github.com/apache/cxf/blob/3dc89fe00c4e4165fc7b9c25ca0faec4ef097a87/core/src/main/java/org/apache/cxf/interceptor/LoggingOutInterceptor.java#L180<br/>
<br/>
Therefore format of logged message is impossible for the Writer case.
  </td>
