                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      An exception is thrown for some inbound messages when logging is enabled via:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.feature.LoggingFeature&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;property name=&quot;prettyLogging&quot; value=&quot;true&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Overriding the default 65536 character limit fixes the problem:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.feature.LoggingFeature&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;property name=&quot;limit&quot; value=&quot;-1&quot; /&gt;<br/>
	&lt;property name=&quot;prettyLogging&quot; value=&quot;true&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
