                <tr id="issuerow12862432" rel="12862432" data-issuekey="CXF-6584" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6584" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6584">CXF-6584</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                EncryptSignature is ignored
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Stefan Pröls
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Stefan Pröls
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Sep/15 14:28 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Sep/15 11:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m trying to write a client for this webservice:<br/>
<br/>
https://rheaavs.element44.net/AvsMpsService_R1_Variante2.wsdl<br/>
<br/>
The WSDL includes a WS-Security policy which specifies<br/>
<br/>
&lt;sp:EncryptSignature/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
However, this does not seem to work, in the created requests the signature is not encrypted. Here is an example of a request created by Apache CXF:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2003/05/soap-envelope&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;soap:Header&gt;<br/>
		&lt;Action xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;<br/>
			xmlns:wsu=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-wssecurity-utility-1.0.xsd&quot;<br/>
			wsu:Id=&quot;_87016533-0fb2-47f5-b5e4-ae89c6a81d13&quot;&gt;HoleStatusReport&lt;/Action&gt;<br/>
		&lt;MessageID xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;<br/>
			xmlns:wsu=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-wssecurity-utility-1.0.xsd&quot;<br/>
			wsu:Id=&quot;_27b4f112-2af6-4af8-bb7e-993dec009b24&quot;&gt;urn:uuid:84f7c468-97c3-4bad-bd38-e564e83c9a93&lt;/MessageID&gt;<br/>
		&lt;To xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;<br/>
			xmlns:wsu=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/wss/2004/01/oasis-200401-wss-wssecurity-utility-1.0.xsd&quot;<br/>
			wsu:Id=&quot;_5958402a-a423-4bbb-a3bb-c961cc32e8d1&quot;&gt;https://rheaavs.element44.net/api/v1/service&lt;/To&gt;<br/>
