                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Example configuration wsdl:<br/>
<br/>
 &lt;binding name=&quot;NameBinding&quot;&gt;<br/>
 &lt;/binding&gt;<br/>
<br/>
 &lt;binding name=&quot;NameBindingSoap12&quot;&gt;<br/>
 &lt;/binding&gt;<br/>
<br/>
 or<br/>
<br/>
 &lt;service name=&quot;NameServices&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;port name=&quot;NameServicePort&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;soap:address location=&quot;...&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/port&gt;<br/>
    &lt;port name=&quot;NameServicePortSoap12&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;soap12:address location=&quot;...&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/port&gt;<br/>
 &lt;/service&gt;<br/>
<br/>
I need to generate the alone client with NameBinding or NameServicePort for SOAP 1.1
