                <tr id="issuerow12901246" rel="12901246" data-issuekey="CXF-6615" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6615" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6615">CXF-6615</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                the order of attributes in SubjectDN of certificate shouldn&#39;t be significant
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Sep/15 07:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 29/Sep/15 09:02 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.7,                     3.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Per the RFC2253, the order of attributes in SubjectDN isn&#39;t significant, and it can vary across different platforms() with different implementations.<br/>
Currently in CXF it assume the order of attributes in SubjectDN is fixed during the SubjectDN comparison, so this can cause some tests failure on some platforms<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
