</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Schema imports are not handled correctly in generated WSDL and XSD files when using catalog rewrites
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
