                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      *Situation:*<br/>
<br/>
- jax-ws-catalog.xml contains:<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;rewriteSystem systemIdStartString=&quot;http://apache.org/xsd/&quot; rewritePrefix=&quot;classpath:/xsd/&quot;/&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
- WSDL structure:<br/>
{code}<br/>
/wsdl/service.wsdl - imports &quot;http://apache.org/xsd/schema.xsd&quot;<br/>
/xsd/schema.xsd<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
*Problem:*<br/>
When accessing &quot;?xsd=http://apache.org/xsd/schema.xsd&quot;, import of &quot;d/included.xsd&quot; is not transformed into &quot;?xsd=&quot; form.<br/>

  </td>
