                                            <td class="environment">      cxf 3.1.2, wss4j 2.1.2, spring boot 1.2.6
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is happening when using SamlTokenInterceptor to validate the inbound saml token via WS-SecurityPolicy.<br/>
<br/>
It seems that the crypto get back from SamlTokenInterceptor is always having null PasswordEncryptor. The keystore password is not therefore decrypted properly.<br/>
<br/>
SamlTokenInterceptor.java line 320:<br/>
crypto = CryptoFactory.getInstance(properties);
  </td>
