                <tr id="issuerow12913392" rel="12913392" data-issuekey="CXF-6678" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6678" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6678">CXF-6678</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                AsyncResponse &amp; outFaultInterceptors
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alberto São Marcos
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alberto São Marcos
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Nov/15 18:32 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Oct/16 18:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Nov/15 10:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      karaf 3.0.4
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      With an _AbstractPhaseInterceptor_ implementation configured as an _outFaultInterceptors_, its _handleMessage_  does not get invoked when an _Exception_ is returned by the _AsyncResponse.resume_ method.<br/>
<br/>
The response does arrive with a 500 response code, but the interceptor does not seem to be invoked at all.<br/>
<br/>
Not sure if a bug or just a know limitation.<br/>

  </td>
