                                            <td class="description">      this message:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
2015-11-17 14:30:32,881 | WARN  | tp1908774823-158 | JAXRSInInterceptor               | 67 - org.apache.cxf.cxf-rt-frontend-jaxrs - 3.1.2 | No root resource matching request path /cxf/rosette/ping has been found, Relative Path: /. Please enable FINE/TRACE log level for more details.<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
is a lie. With logging cranked all the way up, the only detail that is added is:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
2015-11-17 14:30:32,881 | DEBUG | tp1908774823-158 | JAXRSUtils                       | 67 - org.apache.cxf.cxf-rt-frontend-jaxrs - 3.1.2 | Trying to select a resource class, request path : /<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
Once upon a time, the util code would dump out gory details of the process of trying and failing to match. Could we please have this back?<br/>

