                <tr id="issuerow12914427" rel="12914427" data-issuekey="CXF-6685" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6685" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6685">CXF-6685</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF Thread Safety via Proxy.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">             Bharat Savanur
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">             Bharat Savanur
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Nov/15 10:56 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Oct/16 18:49 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Nov/15 13:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
We are using JAXRsClientFactory client proxy as rest client. We have the following requirement where we need to update the header Cookie information if the calling the method throws Redirect Exception.<br/>
<br/>
The following approach is what we have followed:<br/>
<br/>
a)  Create a Singleton Proxy Service in the system which is thread safe.(by passing true as third parameter in the method call).<br/>
<br/>
b)  This will be used across multiple threads.<br/>
<br/>
c) When anyone of the requests fail, what we do is we set the new value of cookie for all the singleton service by accesssing httpConduit and settings its cookie.<br/>
<br/>
Is there any alternative approach for the above.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Thanks and Regards,<br/>
Bharat Savanur
  </td>
