</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently PollingMessageListenerContainer uses internal ServiceExecutor based on FixedThreadPool to pool received JMS messages.<br/>
There is a requirement to provide an option to use external Executor (e.g. ApplicationService executor) for that.<br/>
<br/>
Requirement was discussed in this thread: http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/CXF-3-1-x-missing-taskExecutor-and-unmanaged-threads-td5763221.html <br/>
<br/>

  </td>
