                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        HTTPCLIENT-1649,                                                HTTPCLIENT-1652                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF 3.1.x uses httpclient 4.4.x which has a bug (HTTPCLIENT-1652) related to auth cache. They switched to serialization when caching auth objects and a scenario with authenticated proxy is now broken.<br/>
It is fixed with httpclient 4.5.<br/>
<br/>
Is it ok to upgrade CXF to use httpclient 4.5.x?
  </td>
