                <tr id="issuerow12921053" rel="12921053" data-issuekey="CXF-6705" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6705" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6705">CXF-6705</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Incorrect version in Import-Package for javax.validation for CXF Core
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Dec/15 13:09 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:19 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Dec/15 16:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.5,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I believe that the following are wrong. The versions exported by the servicemix jar are 1.0.0.<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
	javax.validation;resolution:=optional;version=1.1.0.Final,<br/>
	javax.validation.bootstrap;resolution:=optional;version=1.1.0.Final,<br/>
	javax.validation.executable;resolution:=optional;version=1.1.0.Final,<br/>
	javax.validation.spi;resolution:=optional;version=1.1.0.Final,<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
Here&#39;s what servicemix exports:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
xport-Package =<br/>
	javax.validation;<br/>
		uses:=&quot;javax.validation.bootstrap,<br/>
			javax.validation.executable,<br/>
			javax.validation.metadata,<br/>
			javax.validation.spi&quot;;<br/>
		version=1.0.0,<br/>
	javax.validation.bootstrap;uses:=javax.validation;version=1.0.0,<br/>
	javax.validation.constraints;uses:=javax.validation;version=1.0.0,<br/>
	javax.validation.constraintvalidation;version=1.0.0,<br/>
	javax.validation.executable;uses:=javax.validation;version=1.0.0,<br/>
	javax.validation.groups;version=1.0.0,<br/>
	javax.validation.metadata;uses:=javax.validation;version=1.0.0,<br/>
	javax.validation.spi;uses:=javax.validation;version=1.0.0<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
It&#39;s been a while, but I think I can make a fix to this.<br/>

  </td>
