                <tr id="issuerow12921626" rel="12921626" data-issuekey="CXF-6708" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6708" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6708">CXF-6708</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Conflicting class org.apache.cxf.configuration.spring.StringBeanDefinitionParser
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Rohit Jain
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Rohit Jain
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Dec/15 10:52 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Oct/16 18:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/Dec/15 21:14 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Build system            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We have upgraded Spring Security to 4.0.3. However we see that cxf-api  and cxf bundle is not upgraded to use it.<br/>
cxf-core is upgraded to support Spring Security<br/>
<br/>
However we require cxf-core as well as cxf-bundle(for cxf stubbing wsdl2Java)<br/>
<br/>
The issue is that StringBeanDefinitionParser is present in both the these jars with same package name and contents. with one major difference<br/>
StringBeanDefinitionParser in  cxf-core has below line<br/>
builder.addConstructorArgValue(DOMUtils.getRawContent(element)); <br/>
StringBeanDefinitionParser in  cxf-bundle has below line<br/>
builder.addConstructorArg(DOMUtils.getRawContent(element));<br/>
<br/>
Always the StringBeanDefinitionParser in cxf-bindle takes precedence and the war deployment fails.<br/>
<br/>
cxf should make these method calls consistent to cope up with upgraded spring security version<br/>
Don&#39;t understand why this was missed.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
