                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Just had a quick look after the topic came up on -users. Aegis Databiding seems to perform unsafe deserialization when serializedWhenUnknown=true. Now sure how common that is (and actually no experience with aegis at all), but if used and enabled that&#39;s pretty much direct remote code execution.
