{code}<br/>
<br/>
And so on.<br/>
<br/>
I looked in the given class :<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
public X509Certificate[] getCertificateChain(String alias) {<br/>
        return keyManager.getCertificateChain(alias);<br/>
    }<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
At server-side, the issue is as if they never received the Client Certificate.<br/>
<br/>
Can you have a look please?<br/>
<br/>
Kind regards,<br/>
Ludovic
