                <tr id="issuerow12922663" rel="12922663" data-issuekey="CXF-6715" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6715" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6715">CXF-6715</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                SAMLProtocolResponseValidator fails to decrypt an assertion
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Michal Sabo
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Michal Sabo
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Dec/15 10:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/Oct/16 07:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Dec/15 15:28 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.5,                     3.0.8            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS Security            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      During the decryption of the SAML assertion a WSSecurityException exception is thrown, when it fails to load X509 certificate for an EncryptedKey element (org.apache.cxf.rs.security.saml.sso.SAMLProtocolResponseValidator:451). However it seems that the EncryptedKey element is correct according to the XML Encryption Syntax schema.<br/>
<br/>
This is the problematic EncryptedKey element (part of the whole SAML response attached):<br/>
<br/>
{{&lt;xenc:EncryptedKey xmlns:xenc=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/04/xmlenc#&quot; Id=&quot;id-dG6qwCA9nALpsqno8mQK3XEyx2c-&quot;&gt;&lt;xenc:EncryptionMethod Algorithm=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/04/xmlenc#rsa-1_5&quot;/&gt;&lt;xenc:CipherData&gt;&lt;xenc:CipherValue&gt;&lt;/xenc:CipherValue&gt;&lt;/xenc:CipherData&gt;&lt;xenc:ReferenceList&gt;&lt;xenc:DataReference URI=&quot;#id-23qweVuzWC19vHEC-8kpWmk-4bY-&quot;/&gt;&lt;/xenc:ReferenceList&gt;&lt;/xenc:EncryptedKey&gt;}}
  </td>
