                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi All,<br/>
<br/>
When deploying cxf-rt-transports-http-2.7.8.jar to Eclipse Virgo, I keep getting the following exception:<br/>
<br/>
[2015-12-17 17:41:17.794] region-dm-3                  &lt;AG0000E&gt; Application context creation failure for bundle &#39;apache-cxf-http.plan-2.7.8-org.apache.cxf.cxf-rt-transports-http&#39; version &#39;2.7.8&#39;. org.springframework.beans.factory.xml.XmlBeanDefinitionStoreException: Line 27 in XML document from URL [bundleentry://140.fwk799626944/OSGI-INF/blueprint/osgiservlet.xml] is invalid; nested exception is org.xml.sax.SAXParseException; lineNumber: 27; columnNumber: 87; cvc-complex-type.2.4.c: The matching wildcard is strict, but no declaration can be found for element &#39;cm:property-placeholder&#39;.<br/>
