                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The org.apache.cxf.transport.common.gzip.GZIPOutInterceptor exposes the public static method:<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
public static UseGzip gzipPermitted(Message message, boolean force) throws Fault<br/>
{code}<br/>
However, the UseGzip enum has been changed to friendly scope in 3.1.4.  The enum needs to be changed back to public scope or the return type needs to be changed to a visible type.
