                <tr id="issuerow12925005" rel="12925005" data-issuekey="CXF-6729" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6729" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6729">CXF-6729</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                 Version 1 NewCookie is not compliant with RFC 2109
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Neal Hu
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Neal Hu
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Dec/15 07:15 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:10 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Apr/16 09:51 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.7,                     3.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.10,                     3.1.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
From http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc2109.txt and http://stackoverflow.com/questions/572482/why-do-cookie-values-with-whitespace-arrive-at-the-client-side-with-quotes<br/>
the version 1 cookie look like: name=&quot;value with spaces&quot;;Max-Age=3600;Path=&quot;/&quot;;Version=1<br/>
<br/>
NewCookieHeaderProvider.toString(NewCookie) has not handled the special characters(RFC2068) that need around with quotes
  </td>
