  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Working on an act-as ws-federation scenario with a 4.5 .NET WCF webservice, i&#39;m stuck after getting the issued token from the STS.<br/>
When we want to use it in a ws-policy enabled cxf client, we get an error occurred when verifying security for the message on the .net side. <br/>
After investigation, we found that the message sent to the wcf service had an extra SecurityTokenReference at the top level of the wsse:Security element.(below you&#39;ll find the wsdl and the problematic message)<br/>
----------wsdl-----------------------------------------------------------<br/>
