ear war class loader policy : module<br/>
war class loader setting : parent last 
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I use the {{CXFNonSpringJaxrsServlet}} for initialization.<br/>
<br/>
Bean validation is not working for classes registered using the {{javax.ws.rs.core.Application getClasses()}} method.<br/>
<br/>
It only works if I register my classes as singleton using the {{javax.ws.rs.core.Application getSingletons()}}<br/>
<br/>
Similar to CXF-5310 but I believe JAX-RS bean validation support is not optionnal or conditionnal to how classes are registered.
  </td>
