                <tr id="issuerow12933860" rel="12933860" data-issuekey="CXF-6758" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6758" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6758">CXF-6758</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                DataReaderImpl.handleEvent is too strict in case of XMLGregorianCalendar parse error of severity ValidationEvent.ERROR
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Thorsten Möller
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Thorsten Möller
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Jan/16 16:32 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Oct/16 18:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Mar/16 20:13 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      CXF 3.1.4 integrated into JBoss Wildly 10.0.0.CR5, java version 1.8.0_71
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The implementation of {{org.apache.cxf.jaxb.io.DataReaderImpl.handleEvent(ValidationEvent event)}} is too strict in comparison to {{com.sun.xml.internal.bind.v2.runtime.unmarshaller.UnmarshallerImpl.handleEvent(ValidationEvent)}} and returns {{false}} (cannot recover) if the {{ValidationEvent.severity}} equals {{ValidationEvent.ERROR}}.<br/>
<br/>
In the following, details from a real-world Web service where we have encountered this issue.<br/>
<br/>
The issue can be observed when invoking the method {{GetListModel}} of this [Web service|http://webservices.eurotaxglass.com/wsdl/identification-v2.wsdl] whose reply message contains elements of the complex type {{ETGdateType}} that contains a field of type {{xsd:gMonth}} (and  {{xsd:gYear}}). The following is an excerpt of the relevant part of a reply message:<br/>
<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;ProductionStartDate xsi:type=&quot;ns1:ETGdateType&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;Month xsi:type=&quot;xsd:gMonth&quot;&gt;07&lt;/Month&gt;<br/>
  &lt;Year xsi:type=&quot;xsd:gYear&quot;&gt;2010&lt;/Year&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ProductionStartDate&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
If invoked by a service client class from within a Web application deployed to Wildfly (which uses CXF), an unmarshalling error occurs and the following stack trace is logged:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
