                                            <td class="description">      Generate source using below wadl file contains duplicate method name:<br/>
command: wadl2java.bat -p cxf -d . -impl hello.wadl<br/>
<br/>
&lt;application xmlns=&quot;http://wadl.dev.java.net/2009/02&quot; xmlns:xs=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;grammars/&gt;<br/>
