    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6765" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6765">CXF-6765</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                UrlUtils#urlDecode incorrectly decodes encoded path with encoded plus = %2B symbol
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Karsten Ohme
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Karsten Ohme
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Feb/16 02:28 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Oct/16 18:50 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Feb/16 11:59 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      WIndows 7, Java 8
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m decoding some matrix parameters. When using a path with an encoded + (= %2B encoded), e.g. filterValue=Foobar+%2B+Bar which should be &quot;Foobar + Bar&quot;, but it is &quot;Foobar  Bar&quot;, because the %2B is decoded as plus first and later decoded as a space.<br/>
<br/>
The error is produced in org.apache.cxf.common.util.UrlUtils#urlDecode(java.lang.String, java.lang.String, boolean).
  </td>
