                                            <td class="environment">      camel-cxf-transport 2.16.2
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When configuring a cxf-bus with:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.ext.logging.LoggingFeature&quot;&gt;<br/>
 				&lt;property name=&quot;prettyLogging&quot; value=&quot;${cxf.prettyLogging}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
 			&lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
<br/>
you will get NPE inside String.getBytes, because the charset given is null:<br/>
<br/>
