                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      currently it&#39;s<br/>
{code}<br/>
@Override<br/>
    protected void renew(XMLGregorianCalendar terminationTime) throws UnacceptableTerminationTimeFault {<br/>
        UnacceptableTerminationTimeFaultType fault = new UnacceptableTerminationTimeFaultType();<br/>
        throw new UnacceptableTerminationTimeFault(&quot;TerminationTime is not supported&quot;, fault);<br/>
    }<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
and also the subscription.start should support to specify the terminationTime
