                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Sometimes not all of the logging data should be sent out. <br/>
One use case is a UserNameToken authentication where sensitive data is stored in the message body.<br/>
<br/>
The user should be able to configure a filter class in the LoggingFeature. The class could have an interface of<br/>
Event filter(Event);<br/>

  </td>
