                <tr id="issuerow12944884" rel="12944884" data-issuekey="CXF-6803" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6803" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6803">CXF-6803</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF Features depends on old javax.annotation.Priority
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Matthias Steiner
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Matthias Steiner
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Feb/16 12:53 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Feb/16 17:16 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Feb/16 17:14 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Tried to use the SwaggerFeature but got a &#39;Caused by: java.lang.NoClassDefFoundError: javax/annotation/Priority&#39; error.<br/>
<br/>
After looking into the issue I came to the conclusion that the Priority annotation is no longer used in newer versions of the javax.annotation bundle. <br/>
<br/>
It used to be there in 1.2, but it&#39;s no longer in there in 3.1...<br/>
<br/>
See: <br/>
<br/>
1.2 - http://www.java2s.com/Code/Jar/j/Downloadjavaxannotationapi12jar.htm<br/>
3.1 - http://www.java2s.com/Code/Jar/j/Downloadjavaxannotation31jar.htm<br/>
<br/>
Any thoughts/ideas ?<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060">    Moderate
