                <tr id="issuerow12947656" rel="12947656" data-issuekey="CXF-6822" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6822" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6822">CXF-6822</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CLONE - java2ws -createxsdimports with packages that reference other packages should have schemaLocation in schema import
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Cannot Reproduce
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Matthieu Ghilain
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Matthieu Ghilain
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Mar/16 10:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 31/Mar/17 19:37 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Mar/17 20:47 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-1818                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      CXF 3.1.5, Windows 7
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Object in package A references another object in package B. Using -createxsdimports option in java2ws creates schema imports and schemaLocation values properly in the .wsdl file but not in the .xsd files. &lt;It creates xs:import namespace=&quot;value&quot;&gt; without the schemaLocation=&quot;&quot; attribute, causing validation in most xml validators to fail. Workaround is to not use -createxsdimports, so that everything is generated in a single wsdl file, which validates properly. However, the schema files are more readable and reusable when created in separate files, instead of inline within the wsdl file.<br/>
<br/>
Attached sample demonstrates this issue.
  </td>
