  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am developing a code-first SOAP service WSDL of style Document-Literal (Wrapped).<br/>
<br/>
Cannot assign proper message part names using partName argument in @WebParam and @WebResult annotations since the resulting WSDL always defaults to &lt;wsdl:part name=&quot;parameters&quot;&gt;.<br/>
<br/>
The assignment works for header message parts, as well as for Document-Literal (Bare) WSDL style.
