                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi<br/>
<br/>
maybe I missed something but seems DynamicFeatures are supported on server side through @Provider but Features (JAXRS2 ones, not CXF ones) are not. This prevents to reuse some logic like Moxy JAXRS integration for instance which provides a hidden (for end user) ContextProvider&lt;JAXBContext&gt; through a Feature.
