                <tr id="issuerow12954660" rel="12954660" data-issuekey="CXF-6855" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6855" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6855">CXF-6855</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ElementClass annotation is ignored on JAX-RS service interface when generating the WADL
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Stefaan Vanderheyden
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Stefaan Vanderheyden
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Mar/16 15:30 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:10 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/May/16 11:49 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.8            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.10,                     3.1.7,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For the purpose of generating a WADL, contrary to what would be dictated by best practices the &quot;ElementClass&quot; annotation is ignored by CXF when it is placed on the JAX-RS service interface.<br/>
<br/>
The annotation must be present on the service&#39;s implementation in order for the grammar section of the WADL to be generated correctly, and for the response types to be correctly linked to a grammar type.
  </td>
