                <tr id="issuerow12956269" rel="12956269" data-issuekey="CXF-6860" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6860" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6860">CXF-6860</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add option &#39;stylesheet reference&#39; to generate WSDL with stylesheet attached
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrey Nikolov
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrey Nikolov
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Apr/16 20:09 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Apr/16 20:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Build system,                     WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Maven
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The component cxf-java2ws-plugin does not allow to specify stylesheet reference to get attached to the generated WSDL.<br/>
<br/>
Would be convenient to have a plugin option &#39;stylesheet reference&#39; similar to cxf-java2wadl-plugin, so that stylesheet header gets inserted into the WSDL.<br/>
&lt;?xml-stylesheet type=&quot;text/xsl&quot; href=&quot;...&quot;?&gt;
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    WSDL, XSL</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060">    Moderate
