                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
Please update Apache Mina from 2.0.9 to 2.0.13.<br/>
<br/>
We are bound to CXF in our own code and specifically to CXF 3.0.5 through our use of Teiid 8.13.3.<br/>
<br/>
I have another hard dependency on Apache Mina 2.0.13 in the same stack.<br/>
<br/>
If CXF updates Mina in the 3.0.x branch, I can update CXF from 3.0.5 to 3.0.10.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve tested with CXF 3.0.9 so I expect that a 3.0.10 would be OK.<br/>
<br/>
Thank you,<br/>
Gary
