                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m using odata parser to manage odata request. When I&#39;m doing a simple request as : $filter=id eq 1 on object entity containing id parameter, the matching type action is resolved, but when I&#39;m doing it again on a nested object on the same parameter type as : $filter=call.id eq 1 it failed.<br/>
I&#39;m getting the following exception : <br/>
