                <tr id="issuerow12963414" rel="12963414" data-issuekey="CXF-6885" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6885" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6885">CXF-6885</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Enable XSD validation lengths
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Incomplete
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            El Fassi Hamza
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            El Fassi Hamza
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Apr/16 08:18 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 31/Mar/17 19:37 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Mar/17 19:57 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      tomcat 7, Eclipse, Spring, JAX-WS, Maven
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi Community, I&#39;m having an issue with the XSD Validation lenghts, even if the value is set to True.<br/>
My problem is for now with the IN Request, i use cxf-api : version 2.7.3.<br/>
<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;jaxws:endpoint id=&quot;epWSTest&quot;<br/>
            implementor=&quot;com.location.ws.WSTest&quot; address=&quot;/services/WSTest&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;jaxws:binding&gt;<br/>
            &lt;soap:soapBinding version=&quot;1.2&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/jaxws:binding&gt;<br/>
        &lt;jaxws:properties&gt;<br/>
            &lt;entry key=&quot;schema-validation-enabled&quot; value=&quot;true&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/jaxws:properties&gt;<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
NB : CXF version = cxf-api : 2.7.3 , <br/>
Thanks in advance for your return.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
