                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When JAXRS Factory Bean is initialized from the Application class instance which has singletons defined, duplicate beans are being registered, as per WARN messages below:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
May 10, 2016 9:53:05 AM org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.model.OperationResourceInfoComparator compare<br/>
WARNING: Both org.apache.sse.StatsRestServiceImpl#stats and org.apache.sse.StatsRestServiceImpl#stats are equal candidates for handling the current request which can lead to unpredictable results<br/>
May 10, 2016 9:53:17 AM org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.model.OperationResourceInfoComparator compare<br/>
WARNING: Both org.apache.sse.StatsRestServiceImpl#stats and org.apache.sse.StatsRestServiceImpl#stats are equal candidates for handling the current request which can lead to unpredictable results<br/>
{noformat}
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
