  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi, <br/>
<br/>
I am developing a SOAP client with CXF.<br/>
I have the code generated by wsdl2java.<br/>
<br/>
I have done a JAR executable to test.<br/>
When I try to make a request, I do this first:<br/>
<br/>
Service ss = Service.create(wsdlURL, SERVICE_NAME);<br/>
MiNTService port = ss.getPort(MiNTServiceSOAP, MiNTService.class);<br/>
<br/>
The service.create expends 10 minutes<br/>
The gerPort() expends 10 minutes too.<br/>
And after all that time... the request is done.<br/>
<br/>
What could be happening????.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks at all
