                <tr id="issuerow12970336" rel="12970336" data-issuekey="CXF-6907" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6907" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6907">CXF-6907</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF-WSN improvment in onMessage listenner
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Trivial
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Mançaux Pierre-Alexandre
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Mançaux Pierre-Alexandre
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/May/16 11:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Apr/17 19:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Mar/17 14:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.13,                     3.1.11,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JMS,                     Services            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      ServiceMix bundle
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      hello,<br/>
<br/>
i m using servicemix with apache-cxf-wsn as a bundle and i see when i send a jms message on activemq, my consumer take it and i pass 1 second in onMessage method of org.apache.cxf.wsn.jms.JmsSubscription class.<br/>
<br/>
500ms is pass into getEpr method.<br/>
<br/>
I think we can declare a <br/>
<br/>
private W3CEndpointReference epr;<br/>
<br/>
in JmsSubscription and in constructor or in onMessage do :<br/>
<br/>
 if (epr == null) {<br/>
                epr = getEpr();<br/>
            }<br/>
<br/>
with this i win 500ms per message!<br/>
<br/>
in my opinion getEpr is returning always the same W3CEndpointReference value, can you confirm it and i can propose a patch to correct this.<br/>
<br/>
thanks
  </td>
