                                            <td class="description">      Using cxf blueprint configuration, the schemaLocation attribute is ignored.<br/>
<br/>
{code:title=sample config in blueprint|xml}<br/>
&lt;jaxws:endpoint id=&quot;sample-web-service&quot; implementor=&quot;#sampleWebService&quot; address=&quot;http://localhost:56021/services/sample&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;jaxws:schemaLocations&gt;<br/>
		&lt;jaxws:schemaLocation&gt;schema/broken.xsd&lt;/jaxws:schemaLocation&gt;		<br/>
	&lt;/jaxws:schemaLocations&gt;<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Looking at the code, aries blueprint parser hands over the element to org.apache.cxf.jaxws.blueprint.JAXWSBPNamespaceHandler#parse which then just returns null, because there is no parser defined for this element name.
