    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6961" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6961">CXF-6961</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Lots of invalid checkstyle errors reported in eclipse neon
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Jul/16 06:40 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Oct/16 14:21 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Jul/16 18:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.7,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Build system            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Eclipse neon shows lots of checkstyle errors. They seem to be in two categories:<br/>
<br/>
- generated code<br/>
- Too many return statements<br/>
<br/>
The first problem seems to be because checkstyle changed the way to define a suppressions file.<br/>
The second problem is in void methods as checkstyle now has a special property for the number of returns in a void method.<br/>

  </td>
