</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using cxf inside OSGi container and when it starts I have very strange behavior (time to time).<br/>
The JaxRs server&#39;s that defined it blueprint xml publish concurrently via Blueprint Extenders (I find out that by default there is 3 thread of extenders).<br/>
<br/>
It happens if one extender register the service and another extender unregister the same service.<br/>
In logs I see:<br/>
http://pastebin.com/n5A4YeTz<br/>
<br/>
When it happens, services plays hide-and-seek indefinitely.<br/>
<br/>
Aetos 3.0.2.2
