</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In org.apache.cxf.rs.security.oauth2.services.AbstractImplicitGrantService the state parameter is not queryEncoded. Since it could contain spaces (as of RFC 6749 https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6749#page-72) it should be queryEncoded in method finalizeResponse.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

