                <tr id="issuerow12994896" rel="12994896" data-issuekey="CXF-6992" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-6992" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-6992">CXF-6992</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ParamConverterProvider invoked with wrong types
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Zoltan Farkas
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Zoltan Farkas
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Aug/16 13:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Oct/16 18:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Aug/16 11:48 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.8,                     3.0.11,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have created a type: MyType&lt;T&gt;<br/>
<br/>
and registered a ParameterConverterProvider to serialize/de-serialize my type.<br/>
<br/>
when I use my type as in a JAX-RS as:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
@QueryParam(&quot;qparam&quot;) List&lt;MyType&lt;Integer&gt;&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
end invoke the enpoint with:<br/>
<br/>
http://service/enpoint?qparam=abc&amp;qparam=cde<br/>
<br/>
I get ParameterConverterProvider.getConverter(Integer.class,...) invoked<br/>
<br/>
instead of <br/>
<br/>
ParameterConverterProvider.getConverter(MyType.class,...) <br/>
<br/>
which does not look right to me, as such CXF tries to parse the qparam as Integer instead of MyType...
  </td>
