                                            <td class="description">      Right now, the AbstractSTSClient throws an exception if it can&#39;t find an Id in a token retrieved from an STS. However, there are some use-cases, for example if the token is encrypted and we just want to include it in the service request, where an ID isn&#39;t required. This task is to allow STS tokens to have an optional Id.
