                <tr id="issuerow12996181" rel="12996181" data-issuekey="CXF-7006" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7006" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7006">CXF-7006</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                add an util method in AuthorizationUtils which can take AuthorizationFailure cause
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Aug/16 07:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Oct/16 18:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Aug/16 07:37 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.8,                     3.0.11,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      though by default we just return a 401 without any message to say why the authorization failed for more security reason, in some cases like in Customer AccessTokenValidatorService they may wanna return a 401 with entity message like &quot;token expired&quot; which can bring back more info. We better extend AuthorizationUtils a bit to add the method which can take authorizationFailure cause and build response accordingly.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
