                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      From what I understand we setting proxy settings on HttpConduit after we created Client as described [here|http://cxf.apache.org/docs/client-http-transport-including-ssl-support.html#ClientHTTPTransport(includingSSLsupport)-HowtoconfiguretheHTTPConduitfortheSOAPClient] However with Dynamic Client I need to load WSDL which is behind a proxy. Right now DynamicClientFactory.createClient(&quot;https://....?WSDL&quot;) fails before creating client and there is no way I set HttpConduit settings before WSDL url is called.<br/>
<br/>
Note I am not using spring but rather through programming just like described [here|http://cxf.apache.org/docs/dynamic-clients.html]
