                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently XSLT interceptor is configurable only with single stylesheet.<br/>
Very often is required to transform payload from different operations in different way.<br/>
Two extensions will be interesting:<br/>
1) Support configuration of multiple stylesheets depending on operation or other properties (header values, URLs, etc)<br/>
2) Support injection of various properties (operation name, header values, URLs, etc)  into XSLT stylesheet
  </td>
