</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Jetty 9.3.3 Application server, jdk 1.8, Camel 2.15.3 , CXF 3.0.6
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When ever cxf endpoint is invoked first the connection to that endpoint is established, after the response is received connection goes to CLOSE_WAIT and stays in this state forever !!<br/>
<br/>
after a load test i can see 1500+ connections is in close_wait and stays in this state !<br/>
<br/>
Total no. Connection : 1571, TIME_WAIT : 0,  CLOSE_WAIT : 1571, ESTABLISHED:0<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m facing the problems as stated in the below two forums:<br/>
<br/>
1. https://developer.jboss.org/thread/272238<br/>
2. http://stackoverflow.com/questions/39349670/too-many-close-wait-with-jetty-9-3-3-observed<br/>

  </td>
