(or respective JDK8 state), where tag name was &quot;{{&amp;#123;http://java.sun.com/xml/ns/jaxb&amp;#125;schemaBindings}}, {{com.sun.xml.bind.v2.runtime.JAXBContextImpl#rootMap}} was different:<br/>
