                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      There are a few shortcomings when using the existing features in Karaf 4.x.<br/>
Creating specific features and commands will allow:<br/>
  * to not depend on blueprint<br/>
  * to validate the feature definitions correctly<br/>
  * fix existing features <br/>
<br/>
In addition some features have a strong dependency on jetty, while Karaf 4.1 will provide a choice for the http / war provider (jetty, tomcat, undertow), so it would make sense to refactor some features to better leverage those possibilities.
  </td>
