                                            <td class="description">      cxf-core 3.1.7 is not validating the xml with xsd at appropriate location <br/>
<br/>
Exception says:  &lt;faultstring&gt;Could not generate the XML stream caused by: org.xml.sax.SAXParseException: cvc-elt.1: Cannot find the declaration of element &#39;ATT_CheckRS&#39;..&lt;/faultstring&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Sample code is as below <br/>
<br/>
import org.apache.camel.Exchange; <br/>
import org.apache.camel.Message; <br/>
import org.apache.camel.Processor; <br/>
  <br/>
public class TestProcess implements Processor { <br/>
