<br/>
cxf.servlet.init.jaxrs.extensions=json=application/json<br/>
<br/>
Old XML configuration example:<br/>
&lt;param-name&gt;jaxrs.extensions&lt;/param-name&gt;<br/>
  &lt;param-value&gt;<br/>
    xml=application/xml<br/>
    json=application/json<br/>
  &lt;/param-value&gt;<br/>

