                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If you definie in the policy this:<br/>
&lt;sp:AlgorithmSuite&gt;<br/>
						&lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
							&lt;sp:Basic128Rsa15 /&gt;<br/>
							&lt;sp:Basic256Rsa15 /&gt;<br/>
							&lt;sp:Basic128Sha256Rsa15 /&gt;<br/>
							&lt;sp:Basic256Sha256Rsa15 /&gt;<br/>
						&lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
					&lt;/sp:AlgorithmSuite&gt;<br/>
<br/>
It&#39;s only load Base128Rsa15, if you change the order, always load the first one.
