                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We try to avoid logging of authorization header value in out/in requests, we filtered out these in interceptors, but turns out these are logged anyway in [CXF debug mode| https://github.com/apache/cxf/blob/120d20f47022a76970ff0fb9c9d7413cfe019eb2/rt/transports/http/src/main/java/org/apache/cxf/transport/http/Headers.java#L436]:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
        if (LOG.isLoggable(Level.FINE)) {<br/>
            LOG.log(Level.FINE, &quot;Request Headers: &quot; + headers.toString());<br/>
        }<br/>
{code}
