                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We are using the WebClient of CXF to connect to a web resource:<br/>
- Client created using &quot;WebClient.create()&quot;;<br/>
- Content-Type set using &quot;client.type(MediaType.APPLICATION_FORM_URLENCODED_TYPE);&quot;;<br/>
- Send the request &quot;Response info = client.invoke(&quot;POST&quot;, null);&quot;<br/>
<br/>
The Content-Type of the request sent is always with the header &quot;Content-Type: */*&quot;.<br/>
<br/>
Project architecture:<br/>
- JDK 1.7<br/>
- Spring 4.0.5<br/>
- JavaEE 6.0<br/>
<br/>
Thank you in advance for your help.
