                                            <td class="description">      This relates to issue SANTUARIO-452. The idea is that it is possible to configure a value for the KeyName in the properties that will eventually end up in the KeyInfo/KeyName field.<br/>
<br/>
Together with CXF-7080 this provides enough support to handle signing of XML documents where the KeyIdentifier needs to be KeyName.
